warning[L0217]: `shown` binds a Rust path that `display` already binds
 --> check/pattern_implementor_errors.rslisp:1:13
  |
1 | (rust-trait shown "std::fmt::Display"
  |             ^^^^^ this also binds `std::fmt::Display`
  |
  = note: two traits that bind one Rust path can disagree about its implementors
  = help: use `display`, or give `shown` a different Rust path

error[L0404]: `str` does not implement `shown`
