   = note: `clone` is implemented for: bool, char, string, i8, i16, i32, i64, i128, isize, u8, u16, u32, u64, u128, usize, f32, f64, (where (a) (ref a)), (where ((a clone)) (vec a)), (where ((a clone)) (option a)), (where ((a clone) (b clone)) (result a b)), (where ((a clone)) (box a)), (where ((a clone) (b clone)) (pair a b)), (where ((a clone) (b clone)) (pair a b))

error[L0441]: `1` does not fit every type `n` can be
  --> check/pattern_implementor_errors.rslisp:25:19
   |
25 | (defn one (value) 1)
   |                   ^ `n` can be `(ref a)`, which cannot hold this value
