error[L0418]: a type parameter alone cannot implement a trait
  --> check/pattern_implementor_errors.rslisp:32:37
   |
32 | (rust-trait everything "Everything" (where (a) a))
   |                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this would match every type
   |
   = help: wrap the parameter in a type, as in `(where ((a everything)) (ref a))`

